      <description><![CDATA[<h3>0.18.2</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Fixed:</b> Ctrl+C, Ctrl+F and Ctrl+R could be taken by the Window
      menu's tiling items on macOS 15 and later. They now reach the terminal.</li>
  <li><b>Fixed:</b> Control and Option keys stopped working after typing Korean
      in fish 4 and similar programs.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
